From 0fe3e15550e4c6c2c59dc32cb124510494142903 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel <2660793+imDaniel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 12:01:05 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve business JSON types in DSML tool history

Base: 1126 Attention RC3 vLLM 9a71ded060b015e40f721a9caf506e43bd1f3fa0.

Decode only the protocol-level function.arguments envelope before protecting control spellings. Share the existing one- and two-pass decoder and original non-object fallback with the DSML renderer. Literal, nested and schema values retain their types and source text; caller inputs remain unchanged.

Tests: CPU tokenizer render and token-ID regressions for native, JSON and double-JSON arguments, both thinking modes, literal image spellings, schema examples and non-object fallback.

Upstream status: downstream candidate.
---
